      "sat_lighttime": "Light travel time",
      "sat_lighttime_detail": "GPS satellite → receiver: ~70 ms. Geo satellite → receiver: ~250 ms (perceptible delay in geo satellite calls).",
      "sat_receiver": "Receiver position",
