      "no_evolution_disproves_the_origin_of_l": "No — evolution disproves the origin of life",
      "no_evolution_explains_how_life_diversi": "No — evolution explains how life DIVERSIFIES once it exists; the origin of life itself is a separate field called abiogenesis",
      "no_evolution_is_directionless_it_just_": "No — evolution is directionless; it just optimizes for survival in current conditions",
