      "this_module_pulls_from_community_led_o": "This module pulls from community-led orgs — ",
      "this_module_uses_identity_first_langua": "this module uses identity-first language (\"autistic person\") because that is the majority preference in autistic-led communities. Some people and families prefer \"person with autism.\" If you know someone’s preference, use it.",
