      "too_fast_120_bpm_means_shallow_compres": "Too fast (>120 bpm) means shallow compressions and not enough time for the heart to refill between pushes. Aim for 100–120.",
      "too_slow_the_heart_needs_100_120_pushe": "Too slow. The heart needs ~100–120 pushes per minute to circulate blood enough to keep the brain alive.",
