      "20_climate_tectonic_interactions_throu": "20 climate-tectonic interactions through Earth history. Plate motion controls long-term climate by reshaping ocean currents, mountain weathering, and atmospheric CO2.",
      "20_confirmed_meteor_impact_sites_airbu": "20 confirmed meteor impact sites + airbursts, from the 66 Ma Chicxulub asteroid that ended the dinosaurs to the 2013 Chelyabinsk airburst over Russia.",
