      "probably_right_some_workers_will_be_di": "Probably right: some workers WILL be displaced; some institutions WILL be disrupted. Probably wrong: humanity will not lose the ability to think. The hard work is sorting which is which.",
      "pull_extra_hours_yourself_refuse_to_sl": "Pull extra hours yourself. Refuse to slow the deadline.",
