      "same_model_low_pay_early_learn_by_watc": "Same model: low pay early, learn by watching, certify out in 4–6 years. Maine has thousands of openings and not enough hands.",
      "save_against_the_next_bad_year": "Save against the next bad year.",
      "say_it_is_the_tympan_volunteer_to_reti": "Say it is the tympan. Volunteer to retighten it.",
      "say_nothing_hope_someone_else_notices": "Say nothing. Hope someone else notices.",
      "school_announcement": "School announcement",
      "scribal_flourish": "Scribal flourish",
      "sealed_with_the_master_s_mark_witnesse": "— Sealed with the Master's mark · witnessed by the Guild of Printers, Mainz",
      "setting_type_for_the_manuscript_you_sp": "Setting type for the manuscript, you spot a clear misspelling — \"recieve\" instead of \"receive.\" The author is dead (a 14th-century theologian). Modern copies all preserve the error.",
      "seven_full_years": "seven full years",
      "she_inherited_the_press_from_her_first": "She inherited the press from her first husband, kept it through her second marriage to another printer, and continued running it for decades after his death. Over her career the Guillard press produced more than 150 substantial scholarly books. Many bore her own preface or note. Standard 19th-century histories did not mention her.",
      "ship_as_is_hope_buyers_do_not_notice": "Ship as-is. Hope buyers do not notice.",
      "shop_day": "shop day",
      "show_the_apprentice_exactly_which_ink_": "Show the apprentice exactly which ink to ask for, give him a sample, send him with the master's seal.",
      "shun_taverns_and_play": "shun taverns and play",
      "silently_correct_it_no_one_will_notice": "Silently correct it. No one will notice.",
      "skilled_trade_apprentice": "Skilled-trade apprentice",
      "slant_the_roman_type_slightly_using_sh": "Slant the Roman type slightly using shims. Hope the patron does not notice.",
      "slip_the_smudged_page_under_a_clean_on": "Slip the smudged page under a clean one and hope.",
      "start_at_prep_station_observe_sous_che": "Start at prep station, observe sous-chefs, advance through skill. Same apprenticeship structure with a faster ladder.",
      "state_the_truth_it_is_the_compositor_s": "State the truth: it is the compositor's spacing. Volunteer to help him correct it.",
      "stay_and_help_him_skip_dinner": "Stay and help him. Skip dinner.",
      "stop_the_press_go_yourself": "Stop the press, go yourself.",
