      "i_will_always_wear_my_seatbelt_i_will_": "I will always wear my seatbelt. I will not start the car until every passenger is belted in.",
      "i_will_be_kind_to_other_drivers_even_w": "I will be kind to other drivers — even when they aren't kind to me. Road rage has no winners.",
      "i_will_come_to_a_complete_stop_at_ever": "I will come to a complete stop at every stop sign. I will never run a yellow light.",
      "i_will_keep_3_seconds_of_following_dis": "I will keep 3 seconds of following distance in clear weather, 4 seconds in rain, 6+ seconds in snow or fog.",
      "i_will_never_drive_impaired_not_by_alc": "I will never drive impaired — not by alcohol, not by cannabis, not by medication that warns against it, not by lack of sleep.",
      "i_will_never_text_call_or_touch_my_pho": "I will never text, call, or touch my phone while driving. Notifications wait. Texts wait. The deer will not.",
      "i_will_pull_to_the_right_and_stop_for_": "I will pull to the right and stop for emergency vehicles. I will slow down and move over for roadside workers.",
      "i_will_scan_my_mirrors_every_5_8_secon": "I will scan my mirrors every 5-8 seconds. I will look 15 seconds down the road. I will shoulder-check before every lane change.",
      "i_will_slow_down_for_school_zones_cons": "I will slow down for school zones, construction zones, and anywhere I see people.",
